{"results": [{"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-034", "score": 0.082, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-034 | Study family SF-APPA-034: Opponent-relative leverage prevalence sweep\n- observed_research_question: Opponent-relative leverage prevalence sweep\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: How often does an opponent-specific exploitable defensive weakness exist?\n- observed_result: Exploit available 33.3%; trap 23.3%; both 6.7%; neither 50.0%; median best edge 3.79%.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- observed_failure_evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_sample_and_power: 870 pairs\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: 870 ordered team pairs; defense PT edge vs league >= +5% on seed PTs.\n- observed_verdict: descriptive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: Edges depend only on the defense (e.g. DAL PNR +9.2% for every offense), so they are not matchup-specific.\n- auto_confidence: medium (0.65)\n- auto_addresses_question: RQC:RQC-073\n- auto_uses_dataset: DS:NCAA_tournament_and_ratings_data"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-015", "score": 0.076, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-015 | Study family SF-APPS-015: Player BEST/AVOID tier tendency in H2 trigger games (55 series)\n- observed_research_question: Player BEST/AVOID tier tendency in H2 trigger games (55 series)\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: Teams and players differ in how often H2 trigger possessions land on the engine's BEST vs AVOID counter.\n- observed_result: Team AVOID% ranges 50.6% (ORL) to 6.8% (SAC); team BEST% 0.0%-15.8%.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- observed_failure_evidence: No outcome test; player samples 10-178 possessions.\n- observed_sample_and_power: min 10 poss per player\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-048\n- observed_method: trigger_table_clean.csv, 55 series 2022-2026, 179 players, 25 teams, min 10 poss.\n- observed_verdict: descriptive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_confidence: medium (0.65)\n- auto_addresses_question: RQC:RQC-001"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-052", "score": 0.076, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-052 | Study family SF-APPA-052: CUT feasibility cap: BEST-AVOID gap without CUT-heavy games\n- observed_research_question: CUT feasibility cap: BEST-AVOID gap without CUT-heavy games\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: The BEST vs AVOID gap is inflated by games where CUT exceeds 15% of H2 mix.\n- observed_result: All games BEST 1.473 vs AVOID 0.853 gap +0.620 MW p=0.0000 Spearman -0.316 n=2,544. CUT<=15%: +0.625 n=2,508. CUT>15%: +0.163 n.s. n=36. Only 4/272 games had CUT>15%.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: D_positive (no failure: positive result)\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:BASE_RATE\n- observed_failure_evidence: Removing the 4 CUT-heavy games slightly strengthens the gap (+0.620 to +0.625).\n- observed_sample_and_power: 2,544 rows; 272 games\n- auto_validation_status: same_pipeline_validation; evidence: APPA-052: 'tale relative to n-gated +0.375 / best-vs-continue +0.445). robustness direction still holds on this csv. 2,544 rows; 272 game'\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF32\n- observed_verdict: supported\n- auto_confidence: high (1.0)"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-050", "score": 0.072, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-050 | Study family SF-APPA-050: Superstar sequential suppression: opponent play before the star\n- observed_research_question: Superstar sequential suppression: opponent play before the star\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: A specific opponent play type on the preceding possession suppresses each star's next-possession PPP relative to that star's baseline.\n- observed_result: PUTBACK is top suppressor for 6+ stars (e.g. D. Mitchell 1.178 to 0.884, d=-0.294, n_after=95; B. Beal d=-0.345 n=32; C. Holmgren d=-0.222 n=52). Other tops: TRANSITION (A. Davis -0.058), POST_UP (N. Jokic -0.075), PULL_ [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:DRIFT_NONSTATIONARITY\n- observed_failure_evidence: No multiplicity correction; n_after is 32-95 for several PUTBACK cells vs thousands of baseline possessions.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 30 stars; min n_after=30\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED"}], "n_results": 4}

